Blowfish is packed with tons of features.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The original aim of Blowfish was to develop a theme that was simple and lightweight. The theme is a fork of &lt;a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/nunocoracao/congo"&gt;Congo&lt;/a&gt; and expands its initial vision.&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://oscarchavezgallardo.github.io/docs/welcome/featured.svg"/></item><item><title>Getting Started</title><link>https://oscarchavezgallardo.github.io/docs/getting-started/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Feb 2026 14:45:00 -0600</pubDate><author>odchg@ciencias.unam.mx (Oscar Chávez Gallardo)</author><guid>https://oscarchavezgallardo.github.io/docs/getting-started/</guid><description>&lt;div
